      displayTexts:
      - At the center of the room are the robed men, praying at the graveyard. An
        anger takes hold of you. "The Shifts", your mind calls them. A despicable
        group that serves to undermine our uniqueness into a single value number. 
        To serve an oppressive Hand of Spawn. You look to see if you can take something
        from them. You venture closer and attempt to steal something.
      - Without anyone noticing, you manage to take a coin from one of the pockets
        of the Uncounted. On it, it reads, "Coin of S. We live to serve."
      experiencePointsChange: 0
